      "description": "Umair Hoque Chowdhury (born March 23, 2008) is a Digital Creator & Artist based in New York City. A visual artist, editorial model, filmmaker and influencer, he collaborates with Waimeer Chowdhury on his visual sides. As a developer he is the vibe-coded visual core programmer behind umairhoquechowdhury.site and nghsians.com, and is currently developing the texting app Chit-Shat (available upon request while under development). He is a professional graphics designer, VFX specialist, video editor, 3D modeler and drone expert. In production he is a starter musician — his first single, Tomar Golpo (with Jahi Sajid), is available on all major platforms — as well as a cinematographer, photographer, visualist, creative director and producer. Academically he is a high-achieving student leader on track for Fall 2027 college enrollment.",
